  <!-- ===================== Bad Blood ===================== -->

  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>Council_Scenario_BadBlood</defName>
    <label>Bad Blood</label>
    <description>Two families, one valley, and three generations of bad blood. When the colony ship broke apart, the only pods that launched carried the last of two clans who haven't shared a meal in living memory. Now they share everything.\n\nEach family takes one name and stands by its own. Whether they can stand each other is another question. Expect harsh words, cold shoulders, rivalries that outlast the winter, and a council where every vote is a family vote.\n\nThe grudge will fade, given time and a reason. The question is whether the colony lasts that long.</description>
    <scenario>
      <summary>Six survivors from two feuding families, forced to build one colony together. (Rimfolk)</summary>
      <playerFaction>
        <def>PlayerFaction</def>
        <factionDef>PlayerColony</factionDef>
